{title: Khud Ko Kya Samajhti Hai}
{artist: Udit Narayan Abhijeet Kavita Krishnamurthy Jatin Lalit}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Jahaan woh jaayegi,
[A#]Wahin hum jaayenge
[A#]Jahaan woh jaayegi,
[A#]Wahin hum jaayenge
[A#]Khud ko [Gm]kya samajhati hain
[D#]Kitanaa [F]akadati hain
[A#]Kaulej mein [Gm]nayi nayi
[D#]Aayi ek [F]ladaki hain
[D#]Ho yaaron [A#]yeh Humen
[D#]lagati [A#]hain sirafiri
[A#]Aao chakhaa [F]den mazaa
[A#]Taubaa taubaa [G#]ye ada
[A#]Deewani hain [G#]kya pataa
[F#]Puuchho ye kis baat pe
[G#]Itanaa [A#]itaraati hain
[A#]Jaane kis [G#]ki bhuul hain
[A#]Ye gobhi [G#]ka phool hain
[F#]Billi jaise lagati hain
[G#]Mekap jab [A#]karati hain
[Gm]Gaalon pe [F]jo laali hain
[A#]Hothon pe [F]gaali hain
[Gm]Ye jo [F]nakhare vaali hain
[A#]Ladaki hai [F]ya hai bala
[A#]Khud ko [Gm]kya samajhataa hain
[D#]Kitanaa [F]akadataa hain
[A#]Kaulej ka [Gm]nayaa nayaa
[D#]Majanuu yeh [F]lagataa hain
[D#]Humase [A#]ho gayaa
[D#]Ab [A#]isakaa saamanaa
[A#]Aao chakhaa [F]den mazaa
[A#]Humako detaa [G#]hai gulaab
[A#]Niyat isaki [G#]hai kharaab
[F#]Saavan ke andhe ko to
[G#]Hariyaali [A#]dikhati hain
[A#]Kya isako [G#]ye hosh hain
[A#]Ye dharati [G#]par bojh hain
[F#]Mard hain yeh sirf naam ka
[G#]Aakhir kis [A#]kaam ka
[Gm]Cheharaa ab [F]kyon laal hain
[A#]Badali kyon [F]chaal hain
[Gm]Are itana ab [F]kyon behaal hain
[A#]Hum bhi [F]to dekhen zaraa
Khud ko kya samajhataa hain,        Kitanaa akadataa hain
Kaulej ka nayaa nayaa,        Majanuu yeh lagataa hain
Humase aankhen chaar karo,        Chhodo gussaa pyaar karo
Yaaron ke hum yaar hain,        Ladanaa bekaar hain
Ulajhan mein ye pad gaye,        Shaayad hum se dar gaye
Denge bhar ke pyaar ke,        Dekho ye haar ke
Pyaar ki ye reet hain,        Haar bhi jeet hain
Sabase badh kar preet hain,        Lagajaa gale dilarubaa.
